# Behind the Mask's "you may collect evidence 6" (CR 701.59a) is one mana value out of reach: Hill Giant (mana value 4), an Island and the spent Faithless
# Looting (mana value 1) are the whole graveyard, so the option is refused and the spell is cast without it. Bot1's Ornithopter becomes a 4/3 artifact
# creature (no evidence) and attacks for 4; nothing is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Faithless Looting
Behind the Mask
Hill Giant
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Hill Giant; Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Behind the Mask.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Modes(Collect evidence)
Bot1.Modes(Cast without)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile =
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Graveyard = Behind the Mask; Faithless Looting; Island; Hill Giant
